    "header_color": "cyan",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 1,
        "content": [
          "HIN = 远离说话者，HER = 朝向说话者",
          "",
          "基本形式：",
          "hin =（去）那里    her =（来）这里",
          "Wo gehst du hin?（你要去哪儿？）",
          "Komm her!（过来！）",
          "",
          "与副词结合：",
          "hierhin = 到这里    hierher = 到这里",
          "dorthin = 到那里    dorther = 从那里",
          "wohin = 去哪儿       woher = 从哪儿来",
          "",
          "与介词结合：",
          "hinaus/heraus = 出去  hinein/herein = 进来",
          "hinauf/herauf = 上去  hinunter/herunter = 下来",
          "",
          "Komm herein!（进来！—朝向说话者）",
          "Geh hinaus!（出去！—远离说话者）"
        ],
        "pronunciation": "Lektion 40"
      }
    ]
  }
